THIRD-PARTY ASSETS

This project bundles a small number of third-party assets under their
own, separate open licenses. Those assets — and only those assets —
remain under the terms below, regardless of the "All Rights Reserved"
notice above:

- Cinzel and Poppins fonts (assets/fonts/) — SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  Full license text: assets/fonts/OFL-Cinzel.txt,
  assets/fonts/OFL-Poppins.txt.

- Menu, gameplay, and Chuo background music (assets/music/) — CC0 /
  public domain tracks by third-party creators (LushoGames, isaiah658,
  and Ancient.Sounds respectively). See assets/music/README.md for the
  specific track, creator, and source link for each file. The in-game
  Settings screen's Credits panel also lists these.

Any dependency listed in requirements.txt (pygame, numpy) or pulled in
by the build process (PyInstaller, uv, and other tooling referenced in
.github/workflows/) remains under that project's own license — none of
those are covered or affected by this notice either; they are separate
software this project merely uses, not code contained in this
repository.
